1
00:00:00,434 --> 00:00:03,314
They don't care for it
if you stare at them and hyperventilate.

2
00:00:03,478 --> 00:00:05,858
Sadly, that's my home-run swing.

3
00:00:06,356 --> 00:00:08,526
(Leonard:)Look, everything went fine.

4
00:00:08,692 --> 00:00:12,742
(Leonard:)I didn't even have to refer
to my impromptu conversation starters.

5
00:00:12,905 --> 00:00:15,235
That woman across the hall is into me.

6
00:00:15,866 --> 00:00:17,446
(Howard:)Let's go to the tape.

7
00:00:19,411 --> 00:00:21,541
(Howard:)Look at her reaction
to the good-night kiss.

8
00:00:21,705 --> 00:00:26,085
(Howard:)No change in respiration, pupils undilated,
no flushing of the chest.

9
00:00:26,251 --> 00:00:28,291
Nice close-up, by the way.

10
00:00:28,629 --> 00:00:31,759
(Sheldon:)Interesting. Her jaws are clenched.
No tongue access.

11
00:00:31,924 --> 00:00:35,264
(Sheldon:)Clearly a bad sign
amongst mating humans.

12
00:00:35,636 --> 00:00:37,466
(Leonard:)That's not a bad sign.

13
00:00:37,638 --> 00:00:41,228
(Sheldon:)Please. You might as well have been
two iguana with no dewlap enlargement.

14
00:00:42,017 --> 00:00:44,647
(Raj:)And the worst sign of all
is you're here and not there.

15
00:00:44,811 --> 00:00:48,311
(Leonard:)I'm not there,
because I'm taking things slow.

16
00:00:48,482 --> 00:00:51,942
(Leonard:)Which, by the way, compared to you guys,
approaches warp speed.

17
00:00:53,153 --> 00:00:56,153
(Leonard:)And take down that camera.

18
00:00:57,699 --> 00:01:00,659
(Raj:)He was a lot more fun
when he had no hope.

19
00:01:03,372 --> 00:01:05,292
(Howard:)Give him time.

